From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:12:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: Check the CRTC allocation

apple_probe_per_dcp() used the CRTC without checking that kzalloc() returned one.

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/apple_drv.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/apple_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/apple_drv.c
index befb3b8114fd..aa65d816576f 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/apple_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/apple_drv.c
@@ -342,6 +342,8 @@ static int apple_probe_per_dcp(struct device *dev,
 	}
 
 	crtc = kzalloc(sizeof(*crtc), GFP_KERNEL);
+	if (!crtc)
+		return -ENOMEM;
 	ret = drm_crtc_init_with_planes(drm, &crtc->base, primary_plane,
 					NULL,
 					&apple_crtc_funcs, NULL);
